      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "$2p\\sqrt{y}-q\\sqrt{y}=$",
      "worked_solution": "We can combine the two $\\sqrt{y}$ terms together, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2p\\sqrt{y}-q\\sqrt{y} & = \\\\ 2p\\cdot \\sqrt{y}-q\\cdot \\sqrt{y} & = \\\\ (2p-q)\\sqrt{y} & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
