      "name": "Question 8",
      "problem": "Simplify $8\\sqrt{a}+9\\sqrt[3]{a}+3\\sqrt[3]{a}.$",
      "worked_solution": "We can combine the two $\\sqrt[3]{a}$ terms together, but we cannot combine $\\sqrt[3]{a}$ and $\\sqrt{a}$ term:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}8\\sqrt{a}+9\\sqrt[3]{a}+3\\sqrt[3]{a} & = \\\\ 8\\sqrt{a}+(9+3)\\sqrt[3]{a} & = \\\\ 8\\sqrt{a}+12\\sqrt[3]{a} & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
